        "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/aaf5682de789c73f1bea01d19fe4431e.avif?t=1764925994\" width=834 height=1165 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Changes since Early Access!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to your feedback, Cross Blitz has evolved considerably since the beginning of Early Access:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>300+ New cards</strong> for 5 total factions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of <strong>new build archetypes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 New campaigns</strong> in “Fables” Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 New Maps</strong> in “Tusk Tales” Roguelite Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 <strong>New Playable Mercenaries</strong> in “Tusk Tales” Roguelite Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Daily and Weekly Hunts</strong> in “Tusk Tales” Roguelite Mode with leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New unlockable <strong>Cosmetic Card Backs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New and improved <strong>visual card effects and animations</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reworks &amp; Improvements</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revamped questing system in “Fables” Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revamped ‘Card Bucket” reward system after each fight in “Tusk Tales” Roguelite Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless bug fixes and in-depth balancing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your support over the years. Whether you're a new recruit or a seasoned Blitzer joining us from the beginning, Cross Blitz is proud to have you on board!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/34793dc3d50cdb19263360fb6c54d913.poster.avif?t=1764925994\" width=616 height=637 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/34793dc3d50cdb19263360fb6c54d913.webm?t=1764925994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ahoy there! Welcome to <strong>Cross Blitz</strong>, a unique deckbuilder RPG where heartfelt adventure meets fierce, strategic battles! Whether you embark on a thrilling <strong>Story Campaign</strong> or a ruthless <strong>Roguelite Run,</strong> Cross Blitz will push your deckbuilding skills and strategic mind to their limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/6543edce4726db5a0bbd220472525f03.avif?t=1764925994\" width=1200 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Engage in <strong>exhilarating turn-based fights</strong> where any move can turn the tide of battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">For each encounter you face on the 4x4 grid battlefield, you’ll need to carefully consider your card’s <strong>effects and placement</strong>, while strategizing around your deck’s synergies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Draw out the<strong> master tactician within you</strong>: learn your enemy’s moves, deploy clever counterstrategies, and time <strong>devastating “Blitz Burst” ultimate finishers</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experiment with new and exciting ways to crush your foes: hurling bombs, tinkering with deadly bots, cooking up powerful dishes, conjuring demonic groupies, or even releasing shrubasaur stampedes! It’s up to you to mix and match complementary archetypes to draw out the most powerful combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With over <strong>500 cards, 160 relics, and 20 archetypes across 5 factions</strong>, infinite ways to Blitz await! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/4a8cadb5f0a80cf7f1170797061216cd.poster.avif?t=1764925994\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/4a8cadb5f0a80cf7f1170797061216cd.webm?t=1764925994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/4a8cadb5f0a80cf7f1170797061216cd.mp4?t=1764925994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/b7feb8ec3535aa1583c2f55a778d4ce7.avif?t=1764925994\" width=1200 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Arrre ye a hardened adventurer thirsting for challenge? Set sail for our roguelite mode: <strong>Tusk Tales!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose from 20 powerful <strong>mercenaries</strong>, each with their unique<strong> playstyle </strong>and starter deck, and challenge treacherous randomized maps.<strong> </strong>As you progress through each encounter and peculiar locales, strengthen and customize your deck to face <strong>increasingly difficult opponents!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Engage in captivating battles that require strategy and cunning - with more than 200 cards to experiment with - as you build powerful decks to stomp your foes into dust! Easy to pick but chock-full of challenge, you'll have to harness the strength of your minions alongside a plethora of spells, traps, and match-finishing Blitz Bursts if you're to claim victory! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each run will reward you with precious Husks, a currency to invest in your mercenary or to unlock useful items you’ll find in future runs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/5b26430f5738a12bf8d6cc1ccf582b7a.poster.avif?t=1764925994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/5b26430f5738a12bf8d6cc1ccf582b7a.webm?t=1764925994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/5b26430f5738a12bf8d6cc1ccf582b7a.mp4?t=1764925994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/b98d81f0a2207426ad6cc2999fe0e056.avif?t=1764925994\" width=1200 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From the treacherous Swindler’s Wharf to the chilling Frostfall Peak, Crossdawn Isle is a vibrant world packed to the crow’s nest with colorful characters, intriguing locations, and delightful secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Follow 5 determined heroes in the Fables Story Mode, and experience each<strong> full-length story campaign packed with action and intrigue! </strong>From hilarious moments to epic showdowns, witness each hero overcoming their struggles and achieving<strong> profound personal growth</strong>.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Redcroft - A mighty pirate burdened by the weight of legacy,</strong> <strong>forced on a perilous errand to regain his freedom. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Violet - A charming popstar running from her past, on the hunt for her evil doppelganger.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Quill - A pint-sized thief hiding a heart of gold, trying to break free from his crippling debt.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Seto - A noble martial artist searching for his long-lost master and the true meaning of his teachings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mereena - A sheltered but dutiful sprout elf on a journey to bring peace to her divided people.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/b4a215319a5a9b6cd74b170af9f9d19d.poster.avif?t=1764925994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/b4a215319a5a9b6cd74b170af9f9d19d.webm?t=1764925994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/b4a215319a5a9b6cd74b170af9f9d19d.mp4?t=1764925994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/34793dc3d50cdb19263360fb6c54d913.poster.avif?t=1764925994\" width=616 height=637 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/34793dc3d50cdb19263360fb6c54d913.webm?t=1764925994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Ahoy there! Welcome to <strong>Cross Blitz</strong>, a unique deckbuilder RPG where heartfelt adventure meets fierce, strategic battles! Whether you embark on a thrilling <strong>Story Campaign</strong> or a ruthless <strong>Roguelite Run,</strong> Cross Blitz will push your deckbuilding skills and strategic mind to their limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/6543edce4726db5a0bbd220472525f03.avif?t=1764925994\" width=1200 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Engage in <strong>exhilarating turn-based fights</strong> where any move can turn the tide of battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">For each encounter you face on the 4x4 grid battlefield, you’ll need to carefully consider your card’s <strong>effects and placement</strong>, while strategizing around your deck’s synergies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Draw out the<strong> master tactician within you</strong>: learn your enemy’s moves, deploy clever counterstrategies, and time <strong>devastating “Blitz Burst” ultimate finishers</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experiment with new and exciting ways to crush your foes: hurling bombs, tinkering with deadly bots, cooking up powerful dishes, conjuring demonic groupies, or even releasing shrubasaur stampedes! It’s up to you to mix and match complementary archetypes to draw out the most powerful combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With over <strong>500 cards, 160 relics, and 20 archetypes across 5 factions</strong>, infinite ways to Blitz await! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/4a8cadb5f0a80cf7f1170797061216cd.poster.avif?t=1764925994\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/4a8cadb5f0a80cf7f1170797061216cd.webm?t=1764925994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/4a8cadb5f0a80cf7f1170797061216cd.mp4?t=1764925994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/b7feb8ec3535aa1583c2f55a778d4ce7.avif?t=1764925994\" width=1200 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Arrre ye a hardened adventurer thirsting for challenge? Set sail for our roguelite mode: <strong>Tusk Tales!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose from 20 powerful <strong>mercenaries</strong>, each with their unique<strong> playstyle </strong>and starter deck, and challenge treacherous randomized maps.<strong> </strong>As you progress through each encounter and peculiar locales, strengthen and customize your deck to face <strong>increasingly difficult opponents!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Engage in captivating battles that require strategy and cunning - with more than 200 cards to experiment with - as you build powerful decks to stomp your foes into dust! Easy to pick but chock-full of challenge, you'll have to harness the strength of your minions alongside a plethora of spells, traps, and match-finishing Blitz Bursts if you're to claim victory! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each run will reward you with precious Husks, a currency to invest in your mercenary or to unlock useful items you’ll find in future runs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/5b26430f5738a12bf8d6cc1ccf582b7a.poster.avif?t=1764925994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/5b26430f5738a12bf8d6cc1ccf582b7a.webm?t=1764925994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/5b26430f5738a12bf8d6cc1ccf582b7a.mp4?t=1764925994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/b98d81f0a2207426ad6cc2999fe0e056.avif?t=1764925994\" width=1200 height=78 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From the treacherous Swindler’s Wharf to the chilling Frostfall Peak, Crossdawn Isle is a vibrant world packed to the crow’s nest with colorful characters, intriguing locations, and delightful secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Follow 5 determined heroes in the Fables Story Mode, and experience each<strong> full-length story campaign packed with action and intrigue! </strong>From hilarious moments to epic showdowns, witness each hero overcoming their struggles and achieving<strong> profound personal growth</strong>.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Redcroft - A mighty pirate burdened by the weight of legacy,</strong> <strong>forced on a perilous errand to regain his freedom. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Violet - A charming popstar running from her past, on the hunt for her evil doppelganger.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Quill - A pint-sized thief hiding a heart of gold, trying to break free from his crippling debt.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Seto - A noble martial artist searching for his long-lost master and the true meaning of his teachings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mereena - A sheltered but dutiful sprout elf on a journey to bring peace to her divided people.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/b4a215319a5a9b6cd74b170af9f9d19d.poster.avif?t=1764925994\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/b4a215319a5a9b6cd74b170af9f9d19d.webm?t=1764925994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1619520/extras/b4a215319a5a9b6cd74b170af9f9d19d.mp4?t=1764925994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  </p>",
